  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHD Adaptive Regional Stabilisation Initiative 2026-2028 - CHD Adaptive Regional Stabilisation Initiative UKR 2026-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CHD Stabiliseringsinitiativ 2026-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the core strength of the previous Innovative Mediation Initiative (IMI), the Adaptive Regional Stabilisation Initiative (ARSI) is more geographically focused&#xa0;and target high-risk contexts where instability threatens to spill over into broader regional conflicts, enabling flexible, timely, context-sensitive interventions that address root causes and reduce escalation risks.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Initiativet f&#xf6;r adaptiv regional stabilisering (ARSI), som bygger vidare p&#xe5; l&#xe4;rdomar fr&#xe5;n det tidigare medlingsinitiativet (IMI), &#xe4;r mer geografiskt fokuserat och riktar sig mot h&#xf6;griskkontexter d&#xe4;r instabilitet hotar att spilla &#xf6;ver i bredare regionala konflikter. Detta m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r flexibla, snabba och kontextk&#xe4;nsliga insatser som tar itu med bakomliggande orsaker och minskar eskaleringsrisker.</narrative>
  </description>
